   - the REBASE restriction-enzyme data (Roberts, Vincze, Posfai & Macelis,
     Nucleic Acids Research), which belongs to REBASE and should be cited as
     theirs;

   - supplier catalogue figures, which belong to the companies that publish
     them and are recorded here with their source and date.

   The .dna reader was worked out from the bytes of real files for
